+				# zombie check, a defunct pulse-wrapper held the lock for 24+ min
+				# on kidzcity during the 2026-05-19 mini-stress, silently blocking
+				# 12+ cron cycles before manual intervention. /proc/$PID/status is
+				# universally available on Linux container hosts and is the
